    Congratulations, your application to become a 12BET Affiliates has been approved!<br /><br />

    We are glad to have you as part of our Affiliates family and we are looking forward to building a profitable business relationship with you.  Please use the below information to sign into your 12Bet affiliate account:<br /><br />

